---
layout: base.njk
title: Lab Notes
description: Engineering notes from the Odderon Lab bench: prototypes, tests, hardware decisions, and useful failures.
---

<section class="container page-content">
  <header class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Bench log</p>
    <h1>Lab Notes</h1>
    <p>Design notes, tests, failures, measurements, and things worth writing down.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="post-grid">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if not post.data.draft %}
    <article class="note-card">
      <time class="note-date" datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
      <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p class="note-summary">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      <a class="note-link" href="{{ post.url }}" aria-label="Read {{ post.data.title }}">Read →</a>
    </article>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
